  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "768d4b8f-0a2b-4474-8f9c-eb3f879b7f65",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# 02 Rela\u010Dn\u00ED a logick\u00E9 oper\u00E1tory\n**autor: Erik Kr\u00E1l ekral@utb.cz**\n\n---\n\nPro zvl\u00E1dnut\u00ED p\u0159edm\u011Btu mus\u00EDte zn\u00E1t typ \u0060bool\u0060 a zn\u00E1t rela\u010Dn\u00ED a logick\u00E9 oper\u00E1tory . Nezapome\u0148te, \u017Ee op\u011Bt z\u00E1le\u017E\u00ED na priorit\u011B oper\u00E1tor\u016F a pro jistotu pou\u017E\u00EDvejte kulat\u00E9 z\u00E1vorky \u0060()\u0060."
    },
    {
      "id": "d7dedfb2-b51c-4071-b409-42b7e525ac54",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Booleovsk\u00FD v\u00FDraz vrac\u00ED jako v\u00FDslednou hodnotu typ \u0060bool\u0060. Nej\u010Dast\u011Bji jej pou\u017E\u00EDv\u00E1me v podm\u00EDn\u011Bn\u00FDch p\u0159\u00EDkazech v\u00FDb\u011Bru (selection statements) a p\u0159\u00EDkazech pro tvorbu cyklu (iteration statements). P\u0159\u00EDklady booleanovsk\u00FDch v\u00FDraz\u016F jsou rela\u010Dn\u00ED a logick\u00E9 oper\u00E1tory.\n\nTyp bool reprezentuje hodnoty \u0060true\u0060 nebo false, tedy pravda nebo nepravda."
    },
    {
      "id": "94f2df59-7fcf-4b7f-a782-9e36b9e41a9d",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Na n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00EDch p\u0159\u00EDkladech si probereme rela\u010Dn\u00ED a logick\u00E9 oper\u00E1tory. \n\nNejprve si ale definujme t\u0159i prom\u011Bnn\u00E9, cel\u00E1 \u010D\u00EDsla \u0060x\u0060, \u0060y\u0060 a booleanovskou prom\u011Bnnou \u0060vysledek\u0060:"
    },
    {
      "id": "93daed1e-08da-4a60-98f2-858c86af5a5b",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int x = 2;\nint y = 3;\nbool vysledek;"
    },
    {
      "id": "307b1224-4d95-4aa8-b83c-222551997743",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "M\u011Bli byste zn\u00E1t n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00ED rela\u010Dn\u00ED oper\u00E1tory, kter\u00E9 vracej\u00ED jako v\u00FDsledek operace typ \u0060bool\u0060:"
    },
    {
      "id": "58720738-4d60-40c6-bdd1-3e3c7b7c824d",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "vysledek = x == y;  // rovnost\nvysledek = x != y;  // nerovnost\nvysledek = x \u003C y;   // mensi nez\nvysledek = x \u003E y;   // vetsi nez\nvysledek = x \u003C= y;  // nensi nebo rovno\nvysledek = x \u003E= y;  // vetsi nebo rovno"
    },
    {
      "id": "234295d9-9a4c-4373-bb7c-d71cc29d4229",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "D\u00E1le byste m\u011Bli zn\u00E1t logick\u00E9 operace and \u0060\u0026\u0026\u0060 , or \u0060||\u0060 a negace \u0060!\u0060"
    },
    {
      "id": "310795a4-66c6-4984-8b55-e00cc0c898c0",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "vysledek = (x \u003C y) \u0026\u0026 (y == 3); // pravda pokud je x men\u0161\u00ED ne\u017E y a z\u00E1rov\u011B\u0148 y je rovno 3\nvysledek = (x \u003C y) || (y == 2); // pravda pokud je x men\u0161\u00ED ne\u017E y a nebo y je rovno 3\nvysledek = !(x \u003C y); // operator ! neguje vysledek predchozi operace, vyraz je pravda, pokud je x vetsi nebo rovno y"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7565673-8d0f-4d2a-8524-3179a13f2c95",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "V n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00EDch k\u00F3dech je uveden\u00FD kompletn\u00ED p\u0159\u00EDklad a \u0159e\u0161en\u00ED p\u0159\u00EDklad\u016F ze cvi\u010Den\u00ED."
    },
    {
      "id": "6b89b1cc-0a40-4f09-b3ef-fe4c25040922",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "int x = 2;\nint y = 3;\n\nbool vysledek;\n\nvysledek = x == y;  // rovnost\nvysledek = x != y;  // nerovnost\nvysledek = x \u003C y;   // mensi nez\nvysledek = x \u003E y;   // vetsi nez\nvysledek = x \u003C= y;  // nensi nebo rovno\nvysledek = x \u003E= y;  // vetsi nebo rovno\n\nvysledek = (x \u003C y) \u0026\u0026 (y == 3); // pravda pokud je x men\u0161\u00ED ne\u017E y a z\u00E1rov\u011B\u0148 y je rovno 3\nvysledek = (x \u003C y) || (y == 2); // pravda pokud je x men\u0161\u00ED ne\u017E y a nebo y je rovno 3\nvysledek = !(x \u003C y); // operator !neguje vysledek predchozi operace, vyraz je pravda, pokud je x vetsi nebo rovno y"
    },
    {
      "id": "e93a5c56-281c-4420-87f5-f9fdbc27f967",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "---\n## P\u0159\u00EDklady k procvi\u010Dov\u00E1n\u00ED"
    },
    {
      "id": "6cf5b245-34dd-48c3-8451-c866c7c506db",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Zad\u00E1n\u00ED: 1. Troj\u00FAheln\u00EDk"
    },
    {
      "id": "1d7e0bdb-2829-4362-94b7-bcd2b1fea152",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "M\u00E1me troj\u00FAheln\u00EDk zadan\u00FD d\u00E9lkami t\u0159ech stran. Prom\u011Bnn\u00E1 \u0060\u0060\u0060c\u0060\u0060\u0060 p\u0159edstavuje d\u00E9lku p\u0159epony."
    },
    {
      "id": "3d895dc9-7714-4076-afc4-d4fc35298d9b",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "double a = 3.0;\ndouble b = 4.0;\ndouble c = 5.0;\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022odvesna a: {a} odvesna b: {b} p\u0159epona c: {c}\u0022);"
    },
    {
      "id": "68f4c1fe-3c9d-4ce4-b60a-6fae0971dae0",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "- Napi\u0161te v\u00FDraz, kter\u00FD vr\u00E1t\u00ED \u0060\u0060\u0060true\u0060\u0060\u0060, pokud troj\u00FAhlen\u00EDk existuje, tedy sou\u010Det d\u00E9lek dvou libovoln\u00FDch stran je v\u017Edy v\u011Bt\u0161\u00ED ne\u017E d\u00E9lka t\u0159et\u00ED strany."
    },
    {
      "id": "90fe34ea-ce0f-487d-9cbe-d00ca106f2ca",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "5694192f-1e16-460b-9179-e594c884988d",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "- Napi\u0161te v\u00FDraz, kter\u00FD vr\u00E1t\u00ED \u0060\u0060\u0060true\u0060\u0060\u0060, pokud je troj\u00FAhlen\u00EDk pravo\u00FAhl\u00FD"
    },
    {
      "id": "de13d484-348e-4d24-9d5a-a8fbb884265e",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "23fe8efb-c7e0-4d11-a697-84084dc10ebd",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Zad\u00E1n\u00ED: 2. V\u00FDsledky dvou test\u016F\n\nM\u00E1me v\u00FDsledky dvou test\u016F \u0060\u0060\u0060t1\u0060\u0060\u0060 a \u0060\u0060\u0060t2\u0060\u0060\u0060."
    },
    {
      "id": "351e23a0-43c9-4616-b8e1-23c3f5bfb5c5",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "double t1 = 40.0;\ndouble t2 = 70.0;\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022test 1: {t1} test 2: {t2}\u0022);"
    },
    {
      "id": "7da3987a-5fdb-482a-a4d3-e728ca15a0f9",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "- Napi\u0161te v\u00FDraz, kter\u00FD vr\u00E1t\u00ED \u0060\u0060true\u0060\u0060, pokud student splnil **alespo\u0148 jeden** ze dvou test\u016F za v\u00EDce ne\u017E 45 bod\u016F"
    },
    {
      "id": "9c5eea9b-9844-4c08-a719-210c8d59e545",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "383645f4-8e1f-48fc-987a-602ac0b16738",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "- Napi\u0161te v\u00FDraz, kter\u00FD vr\u00E1t\u00ED \u0060\u0060\u0060true\u0060\u0060\u0060, pokud student **nesplnil \u017E\u00E1dn\u00FD** ze dvou test\u016F za v\u00EDce ne\u017E 45 bod\u016F."
    },
