      "source": "* Napi\u0161te v\u00FDraz, kter\u00FD vr\u00E1t\u00ED \u0060\u0060\u0060true\u0060\u0060\u0060, pokud student **splnil ka\u017Ed\u00FD** ze dvou test\u016F za v\u00EDce ne\u017E 45 bod\u016F"
    },
    {
      "id": "56fb9c6d-58d4-48e1-aeda-c89b670c49b2",
      "type": "code",
