      "source": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c1473da6-634e-4620-9d47-141b2b4969a3",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "---\n## \u0158e\u0161en\u00ED p\u0159\u00EDklad\u016F k procvi\u010Dov\u00E1n\u00ED"
    },
    {
      "id": "7d408a69-41a3-4b19-9071-5ca4470db1d9",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "M\u00E1me troj\u00FAheln\u00EDk zadan\u00FD d\u00E9lkami t\u0159ech stran. Prom\u011Bnn\u00E1 \u0060\u0060\u0060c\u0060\u0060\u0060 p\u0159edstavuje d\u00E9lku p\u0159epony."
    },
    {
      "id": "ab4147df-ea74-4425-8a37-fc08439e629b",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "double a = 3.0;\ndouble b = 4.0;\ndouble c = 5.0;\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022odvesna a: {a} odvesna b: {b} p\u0159epona c: {c}\u0022);"
    },
    {
      "id": "2ad1c481-5278-403c-b3bb-9191f8992ea7",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "- Napi\u0161te v\u00FDraz, kter\u00FD vr\u00E1t\u00ED \u0060\u0060\u0060true\u0060\u0060\u0060, pokud troj\u00FAhlen\u00EDk existuje, tedy sou\u010Det d\u00E9lek dvou libovoln\u00FDch stran je v\u017Edy v\u011Bt\u0161\u00ED ne\u017E d\u00E9lka t\u0159et\u00ED strany."
    },
    {
      "id": "74a30338-5b6f-4b87-a024-b6f12f4003ab",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "(a \u002B b \u003E c) \u0026\u0026 (a \u002B c \u003E b) \u0026\u0026 (b \u002B c \u003E a)"
    },
    {
      "id": "aa9a337b-e39d-4c22-8317-0e90b8c1ec8e",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "- Napi\u0161te v\u00FDraz, kter\u00FD vr\u00E1t\u00ED \u0060\u0060\u0060true\u0060\u0060\u0060, pokud je troj\u00FAhlen\u00EDk pravo\u00FAhl\u00FD"
    },
    {
      "id": "32a53d1f-c988-414e-8a80-118e0a0ad567",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "a * a \u002B b * b == c * c // poznamka, diky chybam v zaukrouhlovanim nam v nekterych pripadech nemusi rovnost vychazet"
    },
    {
      "id": "a23c6788-8e42-4966-850a-14fca2941684",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Zad\u00E1n\u00ED: 2. V\u00FDsledky dvou test\u016F\n\nM\u00E1me v\u00FDsledky dvou test\u016F \u0060\u0060\u0060t1\u0060\u0060\u0060 a \u0060\u0060\u0060t2\u0060\u0060\u0060."
    },
    {
      "id": "ce16779e-95d9-4778-8cb5-e69224cff02c",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "double t1 = 40.0;\ndouble t2 = 70.0;\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022test 1: {t1} test 2: {t2}\u0022);"
    },
    {
      "id": "004467aa-caa7-46c0-b4c9-31924d9570f5",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "- Napi\u0161te v\u00FDraz, kter\u00FD vr\u00E1t\u00ED \u0060\u0060true\u0060\u0060, pokud student splnil **alespo\u0148 jeden** ze dvou test\u016F za v\u00EDce ne\u017E 45 bod\u016F"
    },
    {
      "id": "6f35825e-4296-4633-8ee0-7cfea96228a4",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "t1 \u003E 45.0 || t2 \u003E 45.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "de8fc315-48b7-4ccf-9b89-d113b40d1f75",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "- Napi\u0161te v\u00FDraz, kter\u00FD vr\u00E1t\u00ED \u0060\u0060\u0060true\u0060\u0060\u0060, pokud student **nesplnil \u017E\u00E1dn\u00FD** ze dvou test\u016F za v\u00EDce ne\u017E 45 bod\u016F."
    },
    {
      "id": "a29e8dc8-71b9-4c05-aefb-7655433fa273",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "t1 \u003C= 45.0 \u0026\u0026 t2 \u003C= 45.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "87b6bd9f-2557-43c0-9dcb-a3acc484cb18",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "* Napi\u0161te v\u00FDraz, kter\u00FD vr\u00E1t\u00ED \u0060\u0060\u0060true\u0060\u0060\u0060, pokud student **splnil ka\u017Ed\u00FD** ze dvou test\u016F za v\u00EDce ne\u017E 45 bod\u016F"
    },
    {
      "id": "431db324-b690-447b-8791-3ac4342e2b76",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "t1 \u003E 45.0 \u0026\u0026 t2 \u003E 45.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "8ef4711b-cf64-44b9-9f41-8e20f271726b",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "- Napi\u0161te v\u00FDraz, kter\u00FD vr\u00E1t\u00ED \u0060\u0060\u0060true\u0060\u0060\u0060, pokud student splnil **alespo\u0148 jeden** ze dvou test\u016F za v\u00EDce ne\u017E 45 bod\u016F, ale tentokr\u00E1t pou\u017Eijte negaci a oper\u00E1tor \u0060\u0060\u0060\u0026\u0026\u0060\u0060\u0060."
    },
    {
      "id": "c4df804f-5e15-43a9-9f6f-4697fef48344",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "!(t1 \u003C= 45.0 \u0026\u0026 t2 \u003C= 45.0)"
    },
    {
      "id": "d1114308-1454-4f46-849a-44e627b764a4",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Zad\u00E1n\u00ED: 3. V\u00FDsledky t\u0159\u00ED test\u016F\n\nM\u00E1me v\u00FDsledky t\u0159\u00ED test\u016F \u0060\u0060\u0060t1\u0060\u0060\u0060, \u0060\u0060\u0060t2\u0060\u0060\u0060 a \u0060\u0060\u0060t3\u0060\u0060\u0060."
    },
    {
      "id": "4ce6f454-9418-4635-a62a-e0d5427d071f",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "double t1 = 30.0;\ndouble t2 = 40.0;\ndouble t3 = 70.0;\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022test 1: {t1}, test 2: {t2}, test 3: {t3}\u0022);"
    },
    {
      "id": "5a85aec0-2895-4210-82ca-e641cee04ea6",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "- Napi\u0161te v\u00FDraz, kter\u00FD vr\u00E1t\u00ED \u0060\u0060\u0060true\u0060\u0060\u0060, pokud student splnil alespo\u0148 jeden z t\u0159\u00ED test\u016F za v\u00EDce ne\u017E 45 bod\u016F."
    },
    {
      "id": "04c23cae-580b-4ae4-b78e-9540ee1df040",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "(t1 \u003E 45.0) || (t2 \u003E 45.0) || (t3 \u003E 45.0)"
    },
    {
      "id": "b7befe54-e10a-4023-8513-cf4a1eef8698",
      "type": "markdown",
